      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about one moment though. it's what it revealed about me. if i can be that person, then i'm fundamentally defective. i look at people who are actually kind and good, and i just feel like an intruder. like i'm just faking being a human being. honestly, it feels more like justice to just... not be a part of things anymore. like i'm just a mistake that needs to be corrected.",
